ung  child go with these strangers let's go  rachel excellent job thank you rachel  thank you i'm steve ducey i'm brian  kilmeade and i'm ainslie earhart and  click here to subscribe to the fox news  youtube page to catch our hottest  interviews and most compelling analysis

